menu "MultiDeck return button (bootloader)"

    config MULTIDECK_RETURN_GPIO
        int "Button GPIO (pressed = low)"
        default 35
        range 0 54
        help
            The board's BOOT button is GPIO 35. Held down shortly after a reset, it brings back
            MultiDeck instead of the last firmware started.

    config MULTIDECK_RETURN_WINDOW_MS
        int "Time after a reset to look for the button (ms)"
        default 500
        range 0 3000
        help
            Every start waits this long for the button. 0 turns the button check off.

endmenu
